{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\r\n\t\t\t警方表示，皇崗口岸往皇崗方向交通開始繁忙，警方正實施人群及交通管制。<br/>\n<br/>\r\n警方指，前往落客區的車輛，預計需在口岸附近等候約15至30分鐘。<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\r\n編輯：陳曉慶\t\t</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-01T03:38:08.754908+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":74,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-31T17:36:15+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-01T03:31:11.831651+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-01T03:31:11.831651+00:00","content_hash":"1a01b79346c555ba19eb4f492c8420c9eeadd4017ecd11ad1e89d8c7ef39f501","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}